    // able to turn the plane. Turning should reduce the airspeed ... At slow speeds turning would stall") the turn is the wings pulling
    // it round: their lift must hold its weight and pull its TURN PULL (F.turn, times its weight) besides - the drag of that bleeds
    // its speed every turn; and if its speed can't give that much lift (past its wings' most - CL 1) they stall in the turn: they hold
    // what they can of its weight, the rest drops it, its path bends down
    const Gv = g * Math.cos(gam), Pt = Math.min(F.turn * g, Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, (FLY_TURN_CL * q) ** 2 - Gv * Gv))), need = Math.hypot(Gv, Pt) / Math.max(q, 1e-6), cl = Math.min(need, 1);
