  wisps: 'Thin wisps between clouds', ghaze: 'Haze when the weather has no fog',
  clump: 'Busy and empty stretches of sky', clumpw: 'Length of a busy stretch, in screens', clumpd: 'Each deck clusters differently',
  windpile: 'Clouds build up on their downwind side',
  form: 'How often clouds change shape (0 = never)', morph: 'How fast a shape change plays', evolve: 'Puffs slowly swell and shrink', heal: 'How fast a cloud mends after a plane',
  bands: 'Colour steps in the sky gradient', skytex: 'Streaks in the gradient bands (0 = flat)', atmo: 'Distance haze on the back decks',
  cells: 'Sky pixel size (1 = finest)', cellz: 'Finer sky pixels when zoomed out', skyh: 'Share of the screen for the sky', cloudk: 'Size of every cloud (rebuilds)',
