  // the big civilian ships' burning sections (50-land-civships.js c.fire: 1 burning; under the water it builds back
  // slowly while it isn't out, as the lab's ship) - where the fire stands, on top of her there (civFirePoint), down her side
  // to her waterline: the section's outline (user Oct 31: "I was unable to put the fires out on a cruise ship" - the box
  // was still 12 rows over her waterline, where her fires stood before Oct 29: on a ship as tall as the cruise ship, far
  // below her burning top)
