// AIR_TREE_GAP of any airport part - a runway or landing strip, an aircraft hangar, a terminal, a control tower, a windsock - wherever
// it's placed; everything that flies is low there on purpose (taking off, landing, out of its hangar). A tree there brought down
// Cessnas over the apron and the army helicopter out of its door
// (Nov 3 GPU check: a runway's ends keep a longer clear way - its climb-out. The 747s, flying by the flight model now, leave the
